OL,3,GNEWSATesting ordered after mould found
OL,4,Aat primary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FTests are being carried out at a
OL,7,Fprimary school after mould was
OL,8,Fdiscovered in a classroom, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has said.
OL,11,FThe move comes after mould was treated
OL,12,F"immediately" at La Mare de Carteret
OL,13,FPrimary School in Cobo when it was
OL,14,Freported in mid-July.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
