OL,3,GNEWSATesting ordered after mould found
OL,4,Aat primary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustin Diamond, head of operations for
OL,7,Fthe States property unit, said the
OL,8,Fresults of independent tests "will help
OL,9,Fus build a clear understanding of the
OL,10,Fsituation, and any recommendations
OL,11,Farising from the findings will be
OL,12,Fconsidered and acted upon as
OL,13,Fappropriate".
OL,15,FHe said the team would do any necessary
OL,16,Fremedial work "well ahead" of the new
OL,17,Fterm in September.
